479 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (First, I wake up. Then, I get dressed. I walk to school. I do not ride a bike. I do not ride the bus. I like to go to school. It is raining. I do not like rain. I have lunch. I eat a sandwich and an apple.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
480 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (I play outside. I like to play. I read a book. I like to read books. I walk home. I do not like walking home. My mother cooks soup for dinner. The soup is hot. Then, I go to bed. I do not like to go to bed.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
